Living in this environment.

01:13:02.100 --> 01:13:03.100
In a camp.

01:13:03.100 --> 01:13:05.100
A meditation camp like this.

01:13:05.100 --> 01:13:06.100
There is no reason.

01:13:06.100 --> 01:13:10.100
There is no reason that you should break any of the Sheila.

